{"name":"Bright Zenith","hex":"#757cae","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"bright","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Emitting much light; visually dazzling; luminous, lucent, radiant.","Of light: brilliant, intense."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Brightness, glow.\n\n Glory, splendour.","Brightness, glow."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bright"},{"term":"zenith","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The point in the sky vertically above a given position or observer; the point in the celestial sphere opposite the nadir.","The highest point in the sky reached by a celestial body."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/zenith"}],"entries":[{"title":"Zenith","blocks":[{"text":"The zenith is the imaginary point on the celestial sphere directly \"above\" a particular location. \"Above\" means in the vertical direction opposite to the gravity direction at that location (nadir). The zenith is the \"highest\" point on the celestial sphere. The direction opposite of the zenith is the nadir."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/47/Zenith-Nadir-Horizon.svg/330px-Zenith-Nadir-Horizon.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zenith","wikidata":"Q82806"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Tropical-area-mactan-philippines.jpg/500px-Tropical-area-mactan-philippines.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Tropical-area-mactan-philippines.jpg/500px-Tropical-area-mactan-philippines.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The shadows of trees are the shortest on Earth when the Sun is directly overhead (at the zenith). This happens only at solar noon on certain days in the tropics, where the trees' latitude and the Sun's declination are equal.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATropical-area-mactan-philippines.jpg"}],"sounds":{"bright":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/En-us-bright.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/be/En-us-bright.ogg/En-us-bright.ogg.mp3"}],"zenith":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5c/En-uk-zenith.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5c/En-uk-zenith.ogg/En-uk-zenith.ogg.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/49/En-us-zenith.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/49/En-us-zenith.ogg/En-us-zenith.ogg.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fc/En-au-zenith.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fc/En-au-zenith.ogg/En-au-zenith.ogg.mp3"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"2023-07-22 - Cirrocumulus lacunosus - solitary cloud - zenith - DSG1929-1","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/2023-07-22_-_Cirrocumulus_lacunosus_-_solitary_cloud_-_zenith_-_DSG1929-1.jpg/500px-2023-07-22_-_Cirrocumulus_lacunosus_-_solitary_cloud_-_zenith_-_DSG1929-1.jpg","ratio":1.5,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2023-07-22_-_Cirrocumulus_lacunosus_-_solitary_cloud_-_zenith_-_DSG1929-1.jpg","share":0.35625},{"title":"2023-07-22 - Cirrocumulus lacunosus - solitary cloud - zenith - DSG1929-11 - crop mid right","image":"ht